{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "PRO",
 "chapter": 28,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.1",
   "range": "PRO.28.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1c66cb24",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.1#p1-1c66cb24",
     "text": "Because their own conscience accuses them.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "flee when no man pursueth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.2",
   "range": "PRO.28.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "cf6fe14f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.2#p1-cf6fe14f",
     "text": "The state of the commonwealth is often changed.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "many are its princes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.8",
   "range": "PRO.28.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "00fb0199",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.8#p1-00fb0199",
     "text": "For God will take away the wicked usurer, and give his goods to him that will bestow them well.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "it for him that will pity"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.9",
   "range": "PRO.28.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "66efef04",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.9#p1-66efef04",
     "text": "Because it is not of faith which is grounded on God's word or law which the wicked contemn.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "abomination"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.11",
   "range": "PRO.28.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2619dc88",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.11#p1-2619dc88",
     "text": "And judge that he is not wise.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "him out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.12",
   "range": "PRO.28.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5aab2fbc",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.12#p1-5aab2fbc",
     "text": "He is known by his doings to be wicked.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "is hidden"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.14",
   "range": "PRO.28.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5d5e731f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.14#p1-5d5e731f",
     "text": "Which stands in awe of God, and is afraid to offend him.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "feareth always"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.15",
   "range": "PRO.28.15",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "443adc0c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.15#p1-443adc0c",
     "text": "For he can never be satisfied but always oppresses and spoils.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "a wicked ruler over the poor"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.17",
   "range": "PRO.28.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "06c5914e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.17#p1-06c5914e",
     "text": "No one will be able to deliver him.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "sustain him"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.21",
   "range": "PRO.28.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e1660fa9",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.21#p1-e1660fa9",
     "text": "He will be abused for nothing.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "bread that man will transgress"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.22",
   "range": "PRO.28.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9734907b",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.22#p1-9734907b",
     "text": "Meaning, he that is covetous.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "eye"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/PRO.28.25",
   "range": "PRO.28.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a672c214",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/PRO.28.25#p1-a672c214",
     "text": "Will have all things in abundance.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "fat"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
